) VALUES (
    'history-of-nordic-combined',
    '{"en": "History of Nordic Combined: The King''s Discipline", "de": "Geschichte der Nordischen Kombination: Die Königsdisziplin", "fr": "Histoire du combiné nordique : La discipline des rois", "it": "Storia della combinata nordica: La disciplina dei re", "es": "Historia del combinado nórdico: La disciplina de los reyes", "pt": "História do combinado nórdico: A disciplina dos reis", "nl": "Geschiedenis van de Noordse combinatie: De koningsdiscipline", "ar": "تاريخ الجمع الشمالي: رياضة الملوك", "ja": "ノルディック複合の歴史：王の競技", "zh": "Beiou Liangxiang Lishi: Guowang de Xiangmu", "ko": "노르딕 복합의 역사: 왕의 종목"}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "Nordic combined uniquely tests both ski jumping and cross-country skiing in one competition. Known as the King''s Discipline, it demands versatility few athletes possess.", "de": "Die Nordische Kombination testet einzigartig sowohl Skispringen als auch Langlauf in einem Wettkampf.", "fr": "Le combiné nordique teste de manière unique le saut à ski et le ski de fond dans une seule compétition.", "it": "La combinata nordica testa in modo unico sia il salto con gli sci che lo sci di fondo in una sola competizione.", "es": "El combinado nórdico prueba de manera única tanto el salto de esquí como el esquí de fondo en una sola competición.", "pt": "O combinado nórdico testa de forma única tanto o salto de esqui quanto o esqui cross-country em uma competição.", "nl": "De Noordse combinatie test uniek zowel schansspringen als langlaufen in één wedstrijd.", "ar": "يختبر الجمع الشمالي بشكل فريد كلاً من القفز على الجليد والتزلج الريفي في منافسة واحدة", "ja": "ノルディック複合は、スキージャンプとクロスカントリースキーの両方を一つの競技でテストするユニークな種目です。", "zh": "Beiou liangxiang dute de jianyan huaxue tiaoyue he yueye huaxue liangzhong xiangmu.", "ko": "노르딕 복합은 스키점프와 크로스컨트리 스키를 하나의 경기에서 독특하게 테스트합니다."}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "<p><a href=\"/nordic-combined-guide/\">Nordic combined</a> holds a unique position in winter sports. It demands that athletes master two completely different disciplines: the explosive power and aerial skill of ski jumping, and the grinding endurance of cross-country skiing.</p><h2>Why the King''s Discipline?</h2><p>Nordic combined earned its royal nickname because of the complete athlete it requires. A great jumper who can''t ski fast enough will lose the race. An exceptional cross-country skier who can''t jump well will never catch up. Only the most versatile athletes can succeed.</p><p>In Norway, where Nordic skiing is deeply embedded in the national identity, Nordic combined athletes are considered the complete package.</p><h2>Norwegian Origins</h2><p>The first recorded Nordic combined competition took place in 1892 at Holmenkollen in Oslo. Like most winter sports, it emerged from Norwegian skiing traditions where both jumping and cross-country were practiced together.</p><p>The sport quickly spread throughout Scandinavia and into Central Europe, particularly Germany and Austria.</p><h2>World Championships and Games</h2><p>Nordic combined was included in the first Winter Games at Chamonix in 1924, making it one of the original winter sports. The FIS Nordic World Ski Championships have featured the discipline since 1925.</p><p>For decades, the format remained consistent: ski jumping first, then cross-country racing. The Gundersen method, introduced in 1983, converted jumping points directly into time gaps for the cross-country race, creating dramatic head-to-head racing.</p><h2>Evolution of Format</h2><p>The modern World Cup features multiple formats: individual Gundersen events, compact events with shorter gaps, and team competitions. Sprint events with shorter distances have increased the sport''s excitement and accessibility.</p><h2>Great Champions</h2><p>Norwegian legend Bjarte Engen Vik and Germany''s Eric Frenzel have been among the sport''s greatest champions. Modern stars like <a href=\"/jarl-magnus-riiber-profile/\">Jarl Magnus Riiber</a> and <a href=\"/johannes-lamparter-profile/\">Johannes Lamparter</a> have achieved remarkable dominance.</p><p>Riiber, in particular, has redefined what''s possible, winning World Cup overall titles with unprecedented consistency.</p><h2>Venues</h2><p>The sport''s spiritual home remains <a href=\"/holmenkollen-venue-guide/\">Holmenkollen</a>, but venues like <a href=\"/predazzo-venue-guide/\">Predazzo</a> and Seefeld have become major World Cup destinations.</p><h2>Challenges and Future</h2><p>Nordic combined remains one of the few major winter sports without women''s competition at the highest level. Efforts to develop women''s Nordic combined continue, with junior events growing in prominence.</p><p>The sport faces ongoing debates about its future, but its unique demands ensure it remains one of winter sports'' most respected disciplines.</p>", "de": "<p><a href=\"/nordic-combined-guide/\">Die Nordische Kombination</a> nimmt eine einzigartige Position im Wintersport ein. Sie verlangt, dass Athleten zwei völlig verschiedene Disziplinen beherrschen.</p><h2>Warum Königsdisziplin?</h2><p>Die Nordische Kombination erhielt ihren königlichen Spitznamen wegen des kompletten Athleten, den sie erfordert.</p><h2>Norwegische Ursprünge</h2><p>Der erste aufgezeichnete Nordische Kombinations-Wettkampf fand 1892 am <a href=\"/holmenkollen-venue-guide/\">Holmenkollen</a> in Oslo statt.</p><h2>Große Champions</h2><p>Moderne Stars wie <a href=\"/jarl-magnus-riiber-profile/\">Jarl Magnus Riiber</a> und <a href=\"/johannes-lamparter-profile/\">Johannes Lamparter</a> haben bemerkenswerte Dominanz erreicht.</p>", "fr": "<p>Le <a href=\"/nordic-combined-guide/\">combiné nordique</a> occupe une position unique dans les sports d''hiver.</p><h2>Pourquoi la discipline des rois ?</h2><p>Le combiné nordique a gagné son surnom royal en raison de l''athlète complet qu''il exige.</p><h2>Origines norvégiennes</h2><p>La première compétition de combiné nordique enregistrée a eu lieu en 1892 à <a href=\"/holmenkollen-venue-guide/\">Holmenkollen</a> à Oslo.</p><h2>Grands champions</h2><p>Les stars modernes comme <a href=\"/jarl-magnus-riiber-profile/\">Jarl Magnus Riiber</a> et <a href=\"/johannes-lamparter-profile/\">Johannes Lamparter</a> ont atteint une domination remarquable.</p>", "it": "<p>La <a href=\"/nordic-combined-guide/\">combinata nordica</a> occupa una posizione unica negli sport invernali.</p><h2>Perché la disciplina dei re?</h2><p>La combinata nordica ha guadagnato il suo soprannome reale per l''atleta completo che richiede.</p><h2>Origini norvegesi</h2><p>La prima competizione di combinata nordica registrata ebbe luogo nel 1892 a <a href=\"/holmenkollen-venue-guide/\">Holmenkollen</a> a Oslo.</p><h2>Grandi campioni</h2><p>Star moderne come <a href=\"/jarl-magnus-riiber-profile/\">Jarl Magnus Riiber</a> e <a href=\"/johannes-lamparter-profile/\">Johannes Lamparter</a> hanno raggiunto un''eccezionale dominanza.</p>", "es": "<p>El <a href=\"/nordic-combined-guide/\">combinado nórdico</a> ocupa una posición única en los deportes de invierno.</p><h2>¿Por qué la disciplina de los reyes?</h2><p>El combinado nórdico ganó su apodo real debido al atleta completo que requiere.</p>", "pt": "<p>O <a href=\"/nordic-combined-guide/\">combinado nórdico</a> ocupa uma posição única nos esportes de inverno.</p><h2>Por que a disciplina dos reis?</h2><p>O combinado nórdico ganhou seu apelido real devido ao atleta completo que requer.</p>", "nl": "<p>De <a href=\"/nordic-combined-guide/\">Noordse combinatie</a> neemt een unieke positie in de wintersport in.</p><h2>Waarom de koningsdiscipline?</h2><p>De Noordse combinatie verdiende zijn koninklijke bijnaam vanwege de complete atleet die het vereist.</p>", "ar": "<p>يحتل <a href=\"/nordic-combined-guide/\">الجمع الشمالي</a> موقعاً فريداً في الرياضات الشتوية.</p><h2>لماذا رياضة الملوك؟</h2><p>اكتسب الجمع الشمالي لقبه الملكي بسبب الرياضي الكامل الذي يتطلبه.</p>", "ja": "<p><a href=\"/nordic-combined-guide/\">ノルディック複合</a>はウィンタースポーツにおいてユニークな位置を占めています。</p><h2>なぜ王の競技なのか？</h2><p>ノルディック複合が王の競技と呼ばれるのは、完璧なアスリートを必要とするからです。</p>", "zh": "<p><a href=\"/nordic-combined-guide/\">Beiou liangxiang</a> zai dongji yundong zhong zhanju dute weizhi.</p><h2>Wei shenme shi guowang de xiangmu?</h2><p>Beiou liangxiang yinwei xuyao wanzheng de yundongyuan er huode le wangshi chenghu.</p>", "ko": "<p><a href=\"/nordic-combined-guide/\">노르딕 복합</a>은 동계 스포츠에서 독특한 위치를 차지합니다.</p><h2>왜 왕의 종목인가?</h2><p>노르딕 복합은 완벽한 운동선수를 요구하기 때문에 왕의 별명을 얻었습니다.</p>"}'::jsonb,
    'historical',
    'NC',
    '{"en": "History of Nordic combined - The King''s Discipline combining ski jumping and cross-country skiing, demanding complete athletic versatility since 1892.", "de": "Geschichte der Nordischen Kombination - Die Königsdisziplin, die Skispringen und Langlauf kombiniert.", "fr": "Histoire du combiné nordique - La discipline des rois combinant saut à ski et ski de fond.", "it": "Storia della combinata nordica - La disciplina dei re che combina salto con gli sci e sci di fondo.", "es": "Historia del combinado nórdico - La disciplina de los reyes que combina salto de esquí y esquí de fondo.", "pt": "História do combinado nórdico - A disciplina dos reis combinando salto de esqui e esqui cross-country.", "nl": "Geschiedenis van de Noordse combinatie - De koningsdiscipline die schansspringen en langlaufen combineert.", "ar": "تاريخ الجمع الشمالي - رياضة الملوك التي تجمع بين القفز على الجليد والتزلج الريفي", "ja": "ノルディック複合の歴史 - スキージャンプとクロスカントリーを組み合わせた王の競技", "zh": "Beiou liangxiang lishi - Jiehe huaxue tiaoyue he yueye huaxue de guowang xiangmu", "ko": "노르딕 복합의 역사 - 스키점프와 크로스컨트리를 결합한 왕의 종목"}'::jsonb,
    'published',
